	(text "J2 LED pins are variant-specific: -BA- is LED Left:Right = Y:G, so 13/14 are YELLOW and"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 655.32 -227.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "16925bdd-1760-43a1-b67f-caad05c648d5")
	)
	(text "ground (CGND, the RJ45 shell) and signal ground — 1 nF at 2 kV, deliberately not a short."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 655.32 -232.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "23bf334f-5e33-4d00-b729-58118b92a461")
	)
	(text "Feedback crosses the barrier optically: U6 senses 5 V through R53/R54 and sinks the U7 LED;"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 661.67 -50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "28ab833a-5612-4cb1-a973-cbef3c0103a2")
	)
	(text "FB2 splits 3V3A (the W5500's analog/PHY supply) off the digital rail. C50-C56 sit on 3V3A;"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 584.2 -360.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2a10a86d-2367-47d7-ab69-289dce409eac")
	)
	(text "ISOLATION BARRIER — everything left of the dashed line floats at PoE line potential (up to 57 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 627.38 -179.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2d3b6841-f012-4618-ae71-0307cec64082")
	)
	(text "Only four parts may cross it: T1, the U7 optocoupler, and the C89/C90 3 kV Y-capacitors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 627.38 -176.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "374fc11f-310e-4071-bdcc-53e84a378b14")
	)
	(text "U5 integrates both bridge rectifiers, the detection and classification FETs and the hot-swap switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 562.61 -160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "48c4394e-0d72-499c-8f2d-9073d48047d7")
	)
	(text "11/12 GREEN. The -AB- part swaps them. Do not substitute. Wave/hand solder only — no reflow part exists."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 655.32 -224.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4b4a78ce-6c5f-4794-adce-6e81007982fd")
	)
	(text "J2's four line-side centre taps carry PoE to the PD sheet. C67 is the only tie between chassis"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 655.32 -234.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "51511cb0-a414-4477-a9ca-22248cde94dc")
	)
	(text "C57/C58 stay on plain +3V3. Keeping the two apart is what stops SPI noise reaching the PHY."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 584.2 -358.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "673cf794-7e90-4325-92a4-d7ecce4d7599")
	)
	(text "Y1: 25 MHz, CL = 12 pF, +/-30 ppm. R31 (1M) is the bias feedback, R32 (0R) the drive-level trim."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 566.42 -237.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "697df1a6-cfff-4ead-aa3b-6d10632b4354")
	)
	(text "R50 (24.3k) presents the 25k detection signature; R51 (140R) programs Class 1 (<=3.84 W)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 562.61 -157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9eea0abb-b6ad-43f7-90d0-e1fa331e28e1")
	)
	(text "its phototransistor pulls U5's EROUT pin on the primary side. R56/C86 compensate the loop."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 661.67 -48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d5fdb494-24c9-4f29-b7f0-235c8aaa86f9")
	)
	(text "On RX, R36/R37 form the 100 ohm differential load into RCT; C64/C65 AC-couple to the jack."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 695.96 -358.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f5338a11-daa5-4fb2-ac7c-77f8f3c8651c")
	)
	(text "100BASE-TX termination: R33/R34 (49R9) bias TD+/TD- to 3V3A and R35 (10R) feeds TCT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 695.96 -360.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
